OL,3,GNEWSACall for #1.5m to finish city
OL,4,Aregeneration scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore public money could be invested in
OL,7,Fone of Worcestershire's biggest ever
OL,8,Fregeneration projects as it nears
OL,9,Fcompletion.
OL,11,FMalvern-based contractor Speller
OL,12,FMetcalfe has requested a final #1.5m
OL,13,Fcontribution towards the completion of
OL,14,Fthe Angel Place regeneration scheme in
OL,15,FWorcester.
OL,17,FThe project, which includes the
OL,18,Frefurbishment of the Scala Theatre,
OL,19,Frequires additional funding to cover a
OL,20,Frange of extra costs in order to finish
OL,21,Fit, according to a report to the city
OL,22,Fcouncil.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
